  "description": "Where laid-back cruising meets cutting-edge tech, Chatham Rev+ 2 delivers a ride that’s as smooth as it is powerful. Outfitted with an upgraded complete Ananda e-system, this comfort-first electric beach cruiser features a 500W rear hub motor and a fully integrated 48V/500Wh battery that offers up to 75 miles of range on a single charge. Whether you're using full throttle or one of four pedal assist levels, it makes hills, headwinds, and longer rides feel like a breeze. Built for the everyday explorer, Chatham Rev+ 2 rolls effortlessly on extra-wide 3-inch tires with puncture protection. An integrated headlight and included taillight with brake function add visibility for low-light rides, so you can take the scenic route home with confidence. This is the ultimate electric cruiser bike for comfort, style, and everyday adventure.",
